* Vielekezi

⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000001⟫ ina vielekezi.
Kielekezi huhifadhi anwani ya kumbukumbu ya thamani.

Aina ⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000002⟫*T⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000003⟫ ni kielekezi kinachoelekeza kwenye thamani ya aina ⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000004⟫T⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000005⟫. Thamani yake sifuri ni ⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000006⟫nil⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000007⟫.

⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000008⟫

Opereta ⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000009⟫&⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000010⟫ hutengeneza kielekezi kinachoelekeza kwenye operand yake.

⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000011⟫

Opereta ⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000012⟫*⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000013⟫ huwakilisha thamani ya ndani ya kielekezi.

⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000014⟫soma i kupitia kielekezi ⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000015⟫⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000016⟫weka i kupitia kielekezi ⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000017⟫⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000018⟫Hii huitwa "dereferencing" au "indirecting".

Tofauti na C, ⟪GTI18N_7706eaf0_000019⟫ haina hesabu ya vielekezi.

